WEBVTT

00:00:03.265 --> 00:00:08.035
A Boolean Field holds a yes or no value, which appears as a checkbox.

00:00:08.035 --> 00:00:14.205
On the Workshop type, let's add Registration Open as a Boolean Field and open its settings.

00:00:14.672 --> 00:00:17.275
Label is the text beside the checkbox.

00:00:17.275 --> 00:00:22.363
Default value is true decides whether it starts checked when you create an item.

00:00:22.363 --> 00:00:28.042
Let's set the label to Participants can register, turn on Default value is true, and save.

